course: dictionary
lesson: 8112
title: Reopen: open again
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: To reopen means to open again after something has been closed. A shop shut for repairs can reopen on Monday, and a road closed for a storm can reopen when the workers finish.
explain: You can also reopen things that are not doors or roads. To reopen a case, a question or an argument means to start dealing with it again after people thought it was finished. «Picking a scab reopens the wound» means the healing cut opens up again.
explain: Look at the two parts of the word. Re- means again, and open means not closed. Put them together and you get open again. Once you know re- means again, you can work out words like redo, refill and rewrite too.
fact: Reopen is a verb: I reopen, it reopens, it reopened, it is reopening.
fact: The prefix re- means again, so reopen means open again.
fact: «Picking a scab reopens the wound and can leave a bigger scar.»
fact: «A trap takes many hours to reopen»: a flytrap needs hours before it can open again.
fact: «Checking the party photos online reopened the sting every time»: here, reopen means hurt feelings started up again.
exercise: «A trap takes many hours to reopen.» What does reopen mean? | Grow a new leaf | *Open again after it has closed | Close tightly for ever | Fly away
exercise: Look at the parts of the word. What does re- mean? | Not | Under | Very big | *Again
exercise: Which sentence shows a case being started again? | The bell rang for lunch | *The police reopened the old case | The shop closed at six | The cat slept on the mat
test: «Picking the scab reopens the wound.» What happens to the wound? | It turns into a scab for ever | It heals in one day | It stops hurting straight away | *It opens up again and can scar more
test: The photos online reopened the sting every time. Why might looking at photos bring back hurt feelings? | Because the party was in a cinema | Because hurt feelings always stop by themselves | *Because seeing the photos starts the hurt up again | Because photos are always funny
exam: Ella's school was shut for a storm. The head teacher says the school will reopen next week. What does reopen mean? | Move to a new town | Be painted in new colours | *Open again after being closed | Close again for the rest of the year
